{"title":"Educational Coordinator Roadmap","role":"Educational Coordinator","summary":"An Educational Coordinator supports the planning, implementation, monitoring, and improvement of academic activities within schools, education programs, NGOs, EdTech organizations, or educational institutions.","facts":{"Current degree":"Other Teacher Education (D.El.Ed / B.El.Ed / B.P.Ed / ITEP / Integrated B.Sc-B.Ed / BA-B.Ed)","Course":"Elementary Education (D.El.Ed / B.El.Ed)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Educational Coordinator supports the planning, implementation, monitoring, and improvement of academic activities within schools, education programs, NGOs, EdTech organizations, or educational institutions."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits between teaching, academic administration, curriculum implementation, teacher coordination, student support, and education program management."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Coordinating academic schedules and activities"},{"text":"Supporting teachers and academic teams"},{"text":"Monitoring curriculum implementation"},{"text":"Coordinating assessments"},{"text":"Tracking student progress"},{"text":"Organizing teacher-development programs"},{"text":"Preparing academic reports"},{"text":"Communicating with parents and stakeholders"},{"text":"Coordinating educational events and projects"},{"text":"Supporting school improvement initiatives"},{"text":"Implementing digital learning programs"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Qualification note","text":"Eligibility for specific school-based coordinator positions varies by institution, state rules, recognized qualification, teaching experience, and recruitment requirements. A D.El.Ed/B.El.Ed is particularly aligned with elementary education, while some coordinator positions may prefer a bachelor's/master's degree plus teaching or administrative experience."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career Stage","Possible Roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Teaching Associate, Academic Assistant, Education Program Associate"}],[{"text":"1–3 Years"},{"text":"Academic Coordinator, Grade Coordinator, Program Coordinator"}],[{"text":"3–5 Years"},{"text":"Senior Educational Coordinator, Academic Manager"}],[{"text":"5–8 Years"},{"text":"School Academic Head, Education Program Manager"}],[{"text":"8–12 Years"},{"text":"Academic Director, School Operations Manager"}],[{"text":"Long Term"},{"text":"Education Consultant, Education Strategist, School Leader"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the Degree","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Teaching & Child Development Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong elementary-education fundamentals."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Child development"},{"text":"Educational psychology"},{"text":"Learning theories"},{"text":"Elementary pedagogy"},{"text":"Classroom management"},{"text":"Inclusive education"},{"text":"Language development"},{"text":"Numeracy development"},{"text":"Environmental studies pedagogy"},{"text":"Learning difficulties"},{"text":"Child-centred education"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Practice creating:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lesson plans"},{"text":"Worksheets"},{"text":"Classroom activities"},{"text":"Learning games"},{"text":"Story-based learning"},{"text":"Concept maps"},{"text":"Student observation records"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong elementary learning cycle is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Learning Objective","Student Prior Knowledge","Activity / Explanation","Hands-on Practice","Assessment","Feedback","Remedial / Enrichment Activity"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Academic Coordination Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Start developing skills beyond classroom teaching."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Curriculum planning"},{"text":"Academic scheduling"},{"text":"Assessment coordination"},{"text":"Student progress monitoring"},{"text":"Teacher coordination"},{"text":"Parent communication"},{"text":"Event planning"},{"text":"Educational documentation"},{"text":"School records management"},{"text":"Digital classroom tools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important Tools"},{"type":"table","header":["Tool","Purpose"],"rows":[[{"text":"Excel / Google Sheets"},{"text":"Student and academic data"}],[{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Academic presentations"}],[{"text":"Canva"},{"text":"Learning materials"}],[{"text":"Google Workspace"},{"text":"Collaboration"}],[{"text":"LMS"},{"text":"Digital learning"}],[{"text":"Google Classroom"},{"text":"Assignment management"}],[{"text":"Forms"},{"text":"Surveys and assessments"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Academic dashboards"}],[{"text":"AI tools"},{"text":"Content and planning support"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 / Final Stage — Build Coordination & Leadership"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should transition from:"},{"type":"h","text":"“I can teach students”"},{"type":"p","text":"to:"},{"type":"p","text":"“I can coordinate an academic program involving students, teachers, parents, and management.”"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop capability in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Academic planning"},{"text":"Teacher coordination"},{"text":"Timetable management"},{"text":"Assessment planning"},{"text":"Student intervention"},{"text":"Parent communication"},{"text":"Academic reporting"},{"text":"School events"},{"text":"Teacher training"},{"text":"Quality monitoring"},{"text":"Education project management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Core Professional Skills"},{"type":"table","header":["Skill Area","What to Learn"],"rows":[[{"text":"Elementary Pedagogy"},{"text":"Child-centred teaching"}],[{"text":"Academic Planning"},{"text":"Annual/term/monthly planning"}],[{"text":"Curriculum"},{"text":"Curriculum implementation"}],[{"text":"Assessment"},{"text":"Tests, rubrics, progress monitoring"}],[{"text":"Coordination"},{"text":"Teacher and student coordination"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Parents, teachers, management"}],[{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Reports and academic records"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Team coordination"}],[{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Student performance analysis"}],[{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"LMS and digital tools"}],[{"text":"Problem Solving"},{"text":"Academic issue resolution"}],[{"text":"Project Management"},{"text":"Education program execution"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Academic Coordination Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Academic Goals","Annual Academic Plan","Curriculum Mapping","Teacher Allocation","Timetable / Schedule","Classroom Implementation","Assessment","Student Performance Review","Teacher Feedback","Intervention Plan","Progress Monitoring"]},{"type":"p","text":"An Educational Coordinator should be able to monitor this entire cycle rather than focusing only on classroom delivery."},{"type":"h","text":"Curriculum Coordination"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop the ability to translate curriculum requirements into practical classroom plans."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Curriculum mapping"},{"text":"Learning outcomes"},{"text":"Competency-based education"},{"text":"Activity-based learning"},{"text":"Experiential learning"},{"text":"Project-based learning"},{"text":"Differentiated instruction"},{"text":"Remedial education"},{"text":"Enrichment activities"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Curriculum Mapping Example"},{"type":"flow","items":["Grade 5 Mathematics","Annual Learning Outcomes","Term-wise Topics","Monthly Targets","Weekly Lesson Plans","Classroom Activities","Assessment","Learning Gap Analysis"]},{"type":"h","text":"Student Progress Monitoring"},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most valuable coordinator skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Attendance"},{"text":"Assessment scores"},{"text":"Subject performance"},{"text":"Homework completion"},{"text":"Participation"},{"text":"Behavioural observations"},{"text":"Reading ability"},{"text":"Numeracy skills"},{"text":"Learning difficulties"},{"text":"Improvement after intervention"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example Dashboard"},{"type":"table","header":["Indicator","Status"],"rows":[[{"text":"Attendance"},{"text":"92%"}],[{"text":"Mathematics"},{"text":"Needs Support"}],[{"text":"Reading"},{"text":"Improving"}],[{"text":"Science"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Participation"},{"text":"Moderate"}],[{"text":"Homework"},{"text":"88%"}],[{"text":"Intervention"},{"text":"Required"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"The coordinator then works with teachers and parents to determine appropriate interventions."},{"type":"h","text":"Educational Data Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Basic data skills can significantly improve the profile."},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sorting/filtering"},{"text":"Pivot Tables"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"IF/IFS"},{"text":"COUNTIF/SUMIF"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Basic dashboards"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Build dashboards for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Student attendance"},{"text":"Assessment performance"},{"text":"Subject-wise results"},{"text":"Grade-level performance"},{"text":"Learning gaps"},{"text":"Teacher activity"},{"text":"Intervention outcomes"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Student Records","Excel / School System","Data Cleaning","Power BI Dashboard","Identify At-Risk Students","Teacher Intervention","Progress Measurement"]},{"type":"h","text":"Teacher Coordination"},{"type":"p","text":"An Educational Coordinator often acts as a bridge between teachers and school leadership."},{"type":"p","text":"Develop skills in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Teacher scheduling"},{"text":"Meeting coordination"},{"text":"Academic reviews"},{"text":"Lesson-plan monitoring"},{"text":"Resource allocation"},{"text":"Teacher support"},{"text":"Peer-learning sessions"},{"text":"Professional-development coordination"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Teacher Review Cycle"},{"type":"flow","items":["Lesson Planning","Classroom Implementation","Observation","Feedback","Teacher Support","Improved Practice","Follow-up Review"]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective should be professional support and improvement, not merely monitoring teachers."},{"type":"h","text":"Parent & Stakeholder Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"Build professional communication skills for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Parent meetings"},{"text":"Student progress discussions"},{"text":"Academic updates"},{"text":"Attendance concerns"},{"text":"Learning interventions"},{"text":"School events"},{"text":"Feedback collection"},{"text":"Conflict resolution"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Communication Model"},{"type":"flow","items":["Issue Identified","Collect Evidence","Understand Parent/Student Perspective","Explain Situation Clearly","Agree on Action Plan","Follow Up"]},{"type":"h","text":"Inclusive Education"},{"type":"p","text":"Elementary coordinators should understand how to support diverse learners."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn about:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Learning disabilities"},{"text":"Neurodiversity"},{"text":"Differentiated instruction"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Individual learning needs"},{"text":"Classroom accommodations"},{"text":"Inclusive teaching strategies"},{"text":"Early identification of learning difficulties"},{"text":"The coordinator should know when to involve appropriately qualified specialists rather than attempting to diagnose a child independently."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Educational Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop familiarity with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"LMS platforms"},{"text":"Smart classrooms"},{"text":"Digital assessment systems"},{"text":"Online classrooms"},{"text":"Interactive learning tools"},{"text":"Educational apps"},{"text":"Digital attendance"},{"text":"Student information systems"},{"text":"Learning analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Digital Learning Platform","Student Activity Data","Performance Analysis","Learning Gap Identification","Teacher Intervention","Personalized Support"]},{"type":"h","text":"AI in Elementary Education"},{"type":"p","text":"AI literacy is increasingly useful for coordinators."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how AI can support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lesson planning"},{"text":"Worksheet generation"},{"text":"Question creation"},{"text":"Differentiated learning materials"},{"text":"Reading support"},{"text":"Personalized practice"},{"text":"Teacher productivity"},{"text":"Translation"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Academic reporting"},{"text":"Learning analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Responsible AI Use"},{"type":"p","text":"The coordinator should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Student data privacy"},{"text":"Human review"},{"text":"Bias in AI-generated content"},{"text":"Age-appropriate content"},{"text":"Hallucination checking"},{"text":"Teacher oversight"},{"text":"Responsible use of student information"},{"text":"AI should assist teachers and coordinators, not replace professional judgment."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Educational Event & Program Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop the ability to coordinate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Science fairs"},{"text":"Reading programs"},{"text":"Sports events"},{"text":"Parent workshops"},{"text":"Teacher workshops"},{"text":"Competitions"},{"text":"Educational trips"},{"text":"STEM activities"},{"text":"Career-awareness programs"},{"text":"Community education programs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Event Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Objective","Activity Design","Budget / Resources","Teacher Allocation","Student Coordination","Execution","Feedback","Impact Report"]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project Ideas"}]},{"heading":"Student Progress Monitoring System","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Create a structured system for tracking:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Attendance"},{"text":"Assessments"},{"text":"Subject performance"},{"text":"Learning gaps"},{"text":"Intervention"},{"text":"Improvement"}]}]},{"heading":"Elementary Learning Analytics Dashboard","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Use Excel/Power BI to create a school-level academic dashboard."}]},{"heading":"Early Learning Gap Identification","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Study methods for identifying reading/numeracy difficulties at the elementary level and designing interventions."}]},{"heading":"Teacher Coordination Framework","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop a framework for improving lesson planning, peer collaboration, assessment, and teacher support."}]},{"heading":"Digital Learning Implementation Study","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Study the effectiveness of digital learning tools in elementary classrooms."}]},{"heading":"AI-Assisted Academic Coordination","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Design a responsible AI framework for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lesson planning"},{"text":"Assessment generation"},{"text":"Academic reports"},{"text":"Student progress analysis"},{"text":"Teacher support"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Primary schools"},{"text":"Elementary schools"},{"text":"International schools"},{"text":"CBSE/ICSE/state-board schools"},{"text":"EdTech companies"},{"text":"Education NGOs"},{"text":"Teacher-training organizations"},{"text":"Curriculum companies"},{"text":"Assessment organizations"},{"text":"Education-focused startups"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Search for Roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Academic Intern"},{"text":"Teaching Intern"},{"text":"Education Program Intern"},{"text":"Academic Coordinator Intern"},{"text":"Curriculum Intern"},{"text":"Learning Support Intern"},{"text":"Education Operations Intern"},{"text":"Assessment Intern"},{"text":"EdTech Intern"},{"text":"Teacher Development Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Role","Main Responsibility"],"rows":[[{"text":"Teaching Associate"},{"text":"Classroom support"}],[{"text":"Primary Teacher"},{"text":"Elementary teaching"}],[{"text":"Academic Assistant"},{"text":"Academic administration"}],[{"text":"Academic Coordinator"},{"text":"Academic coordination"}],[{"text":"Grade Coordinator"},{"text":"Grade-level management"}],[{"text":"Curriculum Associate"},{"text":"Curriculum implementation"}],[{"text":"Education Program Associate"},{"text":"Education projects"}],[{"text":"Assessment Associate"},{"text":"Testing and evaluation"}],[{"text":"Learning Support Associate"},{"text":"Student learning support"}],[{"text":"EdTech Implementation Associate"},{"text":"Technology implementation"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For many organizations, teaching experience followed by coordination experience is a strong route into more senior Educational Coordinator positions."},{"type":"h","text":"Employer Skill Matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Priority"],"rows":[[{"text":"Elementary Education"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Child Development"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Pedagogy"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Classroom Management"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Curriculum Planning"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Assessment"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Teacher Coordination"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Parent Communication"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"LMS"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Educational Technology"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"AI in Education"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Project Management"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Additional Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Child-centred education"},{"text":"Inclusive education"},{"text":"Educational assessment"},{"text":"Instructional design"},{"text":"Curriculum design"},{"text":"Classroom management"},{"text":"Learning analytics"},{"text":"Educational technology"},{"text":"AI in Education"},{"text":"Google Workspace for Education"},{"text":"Microsoft education tools"},{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Special/inclusive education fundamentals"},{"text":"For candidates targeting school leadership or senior academic roles, postgraduate study can become valuable."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Higher Education Options"},{"type":"h","text":"Education"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Ed"},{"text":"M.A. Education"},{"text":"M.A. Educational Psychology"},{"text":"M.A. Curriculum & Instruction"},{"text":"M.A. Educational Leadership"},{"text":"M.A. Education Technology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA"},{"text":"MBA Education Management"},{"text":"MBA Operations"},{"text":"MBA Human Resources"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology / Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"For an EdTech-oriented pathway:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Educational Technology"},{"text":"Learning Sciences"},{"text":"Learning Analytics"},{"text":"Data Analytics"},{"text":"Instructional Technology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"flow","items":["D.El.Ed / B.El.Ed / Relevant UG","M.Ed / MA Education","Research / Eligibility Pathway","Ph.D.","Education Research / Academia / Policy"]},{"type":"h","text":"Career Specializations"},{"type":"p","text":"An Educational Coordinator can specialize in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Academic Coordination"},{"type":"h","text":"Elementary Education"},{"type":"h","text":"Curriculum Implementation"},{"type":"h","text":"Teacher Development"},{"type":"h","text":"Assessment & Evaluation"},{"type":"h","text":"Learning Support"},{"type":"h","text":"Inclusive Education"},{"type":"h","text":"STEM Education"},{"type":"h","text":"EdTech Implementation"},{"type":"h","text":"Learning Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"School Improvement"},{"type":"h","text":"Education Program Management"},{"type":"h","text":"Parent & Community Engagement"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-enabled Education"}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Education Graduate","Teacher / Teaching Associate","Academic Assistant","Educational Coordinator","Senior Educational Coordinator","Academic Manager","Academic Head / Program Manager","Academic Director","Education Consultant / Education Strategist"]},{"type":"p","text":"An alternative EdTech pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Education Graduate","EdTech / Academic Associate","Implementation Specialist","Academic Program Manager","Learning Program Lead","Education Technology Consultant"]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies to Learn"},{"type":"p","text":"Future-ready Educational Coordinators should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"Adaptive learning"},{"text":"AI tutoring systems"},{"text":"Learning analytics"},{"text":"Digital assessment"},{"text":"AR/VR learning"},{"text":"Gamification"},{"text":"Learning Experience Platforms"},{"text":"Student Information Systems"},{"text":"AI-assisted curriculum design"},{"text":"Automated academic reporting"},{"text":"Accessibility technology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Elementary Pedagogy","Academic Administration","Data","EdTech","AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Education"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Elementary Pedagogy"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Child Development"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Inclusive Education"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Classroom Management"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Assessment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Academic Coordination"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Curriculum Planning"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Teacher Coordination"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Student Progress Monitoring"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Parent Communication"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Academic Reporting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"LMS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Digital Assessment"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Generative AI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Leadership"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Problem Solving"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Team Coordination"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Event Management"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Project Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should ideally have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong elementary pedagogy"},{"text":"Practical classroom experience"},{"text":"Curriculum planning capability"},{"text":"Assessment-design skills"},{"text":"Student progress-monitoring experience"},{"text":"Teacher coordination exposure"},{"text":"Parent communication skills"},{"text":"Educational documentation ability"},{"text":"Excel proficiency"},{"text":"Basic Power BI capability"},{"text":"LMS/digital-learning experience"},{"text":"Inclusive education awareness"},{"text":"AI literacy"},{"text":"Educational project experience"},{"text":"Strong presentation and communication skills"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Portfolio"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"5+ Elementary Lesson Plans"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"2 Curriculum Maps"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"2 Assessment / Rubric Samples"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 Student Progress Dashboard"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 Educational Research Project"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 Teacher Workshop"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 Digital Learning Project"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 AI-in-Education Project"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 School / Education Internship"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For Educational Coordinator, the ideal graduate profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Elementary Pedagogy","Curriculum","Assessment","Teacher Coordination","Student Analytics","EdTech","Communication"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This creates a pathway from classroom teaching → academic coordination → academic management → education leadership/consulting, while keeping the graduate relevant to both traditional schools and the rapidly expanding EdTech and data-driven education ecosystem."}]}]}